        -:  121:FLT_EVAL_METHOD is 2 on x87 -- 32-bit x86, and any build using -mfpmath=387 --
        -:  122:so an NV expression is evaluated in the 80-bit registers and rounded only when
        -:  123:it is spilled to memory. C99 says a cast or an assignment rounds, but gcc
