        -: 9934:#define DENS_DELMAX 1000.0
        -: 9935:
        -: 9936:/*all.equal.numeric()'s default tolerance.  density() reaches for it twice:
        -: 9937:to decide whether user weights summed to one (and so should be re-normalised
        -: 9938:after NA removal), and to decide whether to warn that they did not.*/
